OL,3,GNEWSAMore buses from 2027 in #67m
OL,4,Atransport shake-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents of a rural county are being
OL,7,Fpromised more frequent buses, Saturday
OL,8,Fservices, new routes and new community
OL,9,Ftransport services from next summer.
OL,11,FDorset Council's cabinet has agreed a
OL,12,F#67.6m, seven-year transport
OL,13,F"transformation" programme, including
OL,14,Fadditional investment totalling #39.3m.
OL,16,FThe plan aims to shift funding away
OL,17,Ffrom specialist transport provision and
OL,18,Ftowards strengthening the wider
OL,19,Ftransport system.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
